WEBVTT

00:34:58.290 --> 00:35:01.019
the importance of speed
in sharing information.

00:35:01.772 --> 00:35:03.280
Carmen became a major force

00:35:03.304 --> 00:35:06.686
in ushering the intelligence community in
to the digital era,

00:35:06.710 --> 00:35:09.946
enabling people to share ideas
online in real time

00:35:09.970 --> 00:35:12.806
in a secure way across agencies.

00:35:12.830 --> 00:35:14.946
She ended up getting promoted

00:35:14.970 --> 00:35:18.906
all the way up to Deputy
Director of Intelligence at the CIA.

00:35:18.930 --> 00:35:21.601
CM: You're not going to win those battles

00:35:22.430 --> 00:35:24.956
if you do a frontal assault every time.

00:35:24.980 --> 00:35:28.853
And sadly, for a lot of organizations,